---
const standards = [
  { number: "01", label: "Sources", href: "#sources" },
  { number: "02", label: "Verification", href: "#verification" },
  { number: "03", label: "AI use", href: "#ai-use" },
  { number: "04", label: "Corrections", href: "#corrections" },
  { number: "05", label: "Commercial independence", href: "#commercial-independence" },
] as const;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="How Portfilo handles sourcing, verification, AI use, corrections, and commercial independence."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f0e8" />
    <title>Research & Standards | Portfilo</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#standards-content">Skip to standards</a>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Portfilo home">
        <span class="wordmark__inner">
          <span class="wordmark__port">Port</span><span class="wordmark__fi">fi</span><span class="wordmark__lo">lo</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="site-header__strapline">Practical intelligence for ambitious Filipinos</p>
      <p class="site-header__section">Standards</p>
    </header>

    <main id="standards-content" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="standards-hero" aria-labelledby="standards-title">
        <p class="standards-kicker">Research / Standards</p>
        <h1 id="standards-title">How Portfilo works with evidence.</h1>
        <p class="standards-intro">
          We use reporting, documents, data, and other evidence to establish what a
          story can support. These standards explain how we source information,
          verify important claims, use AI, correct errors, and keep commercial
          interests separate from editorial conclusions.
        </p>

        <nav class="standards-index" aria-label="Research and standards sections">
          <p class="standards-index__label">On this page</p>
          <ol>
            {
              standards.map((item) => (
                <li>
                  <a href={item.href}>
                    <span>{item.number}</span>
                    <strong>{item.label}</strong>
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ol>
        </nav>
      </section>

      <section class="standard-section" id="sources" aria-labelledby="sources-title">
        <header class="standard-section__head">
          <p>01 / Sources</p>
          <p>Where information comes from</p>
        </header>
        <div class="standard-section__layout">
          <div class="standard-section__title">
            <h2 id="sources-title">Start as close to the evidence as possible.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-section__body">
            <p>
              We prefer primary sources when they are available: official datasets,
              laws and regulations, company filings and records, peer-reviewed
              research, original datasets, direct interviews, official documentation,
              transcripts, and records created by the event being reported.
            </p>
            <p>
              Independent reporting and research can provide corroboration, context,
              and facts that cannot be reconstructed from primary material. Market
              platforms, surveys, social posts, and community discussions can also be
              useful, but we examine what they can actually establish before relying
              on them.
            </p>
            <p>
              A person or company saying something proves that they made the claim.
              It does not automatically prove that the underlying claim is true.
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="evidence-note" aria-label="Source principle">
            <p class="evidence-note__label">Source principle</p>
            <p>Relevance and methodology matter more than a source label alone.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="standard-section" id="verification" aria-labelledby="verification-title">
        <header class="standard-section__head">
          <p>02 / Verification</p>
          <p>What happens before publication</p>
        </header>
        <div class="standard-section__layout">
          <div class="standard-section__title">
            <h2 id="verification-title">Important claims have to survive a skeptical check.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-section__body">
            <p>
              Consequential factual claims are checked against their underlying
              evidence. Before publication, we audit material numbers, dates, names,
              titles, quotations, company claims, legal or regulatory claims, and
              other assertions where an error could change the story.
            </p>
            <p>
              We also look for evidence that challenges the emerging conclusion.
              Competing datasets, different methodologies, selection bias, weak causal
              reasoning, stale information, and financially interested sources can all
              change what a story should say.
            </p>
            <p>
              If the evidence is incomplete, we qualify the claim, explain the
              limitation when it matters, continue reporting, or remove the claim. We
              do not turn missing evidence into false precision.
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="verification-flow" aria-label="Verification outcomes">
            <p>Unsupported material</p>
            <ol>
              <li><span>01</span> Find evidence</li>
              <li><span>02</span> Qualify the statement</li>
              <li><span>03</span> Remove it</li>
            </ol>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ai-section" id="ai-use" aria-labelledby="ai-title">
        <div class="ai-section__inner">
          <header class="ai-section__head">
            <p>03 / AI use</p>
            <p>Assistance is not evidence</p>
          </header>
          <div class="ai-section__statement">
            <p class="ai-section__marker" aria-hidden="true">03</p>
            <h2 id="ai-title">AI can help with the work. It cannot establish the facts.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-section__columns">
            <div>
              <h3>AI may assist with</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>finding research leads and possible sources;</li>
                <li>organizing and summarizing documents;</li>
                <li>comparing sources and identifying contradictions;</li>
                <li>calculation or code assistance;</li>
                <li>developing questions, structure, drafts, and edits;</li>
                <li>skeptical review that points to claims needing another check.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>AI cannot substitute for</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>a source;</li>
                <li>evidence;</li>
                <li>verification;</li>
                <li>reporting;</li>
                <li>authority for a quotation, statistic, attribution, law, or current fact.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="ai-section__rule">
            Factual material surfaced by AI must be independently checked before it
            can be published.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="standard-section correction-section" id="corrections" aria-labelledby="corrections-title">
        <header class="standard-section__head">
          <p>04 / Corrections</p>
          <p>What happens when we get a material fact wrong</p>
        </header>
        <div class="standard-section__layout">
          <div class="standard-section__title">
            <h2 id="corrections-title">Material factual errors are corrected visibly.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-section__body">
            <p>
              When a consequential factual error is found, we correct the story and
              attach a visible correction note. The note should state the correction
              date, what was wrong, and what is correct.
            </p>
            <p>
              We do not silently rewrite a material error in a way that hides the
              correction. Minor typographical or formatting fixes do not require a
              formal correction unless they change meaning.
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="correction-note" aria-label="Correction note format">
            <p>Correction record</p>
            <dl>
              <div>
                <dt>Date</dt>
                <dd>When the correction was made</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>Wrong</dt>
                <dd>What the story previously said</dd>
              </div>
              <div>
                <dt>Correct</dt>
                <dd>What the evidence supports</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="standard-section commercial-section" id="commercial-independence" aria-labelledby="commercial-title">
        <header class="standard-section__head">
          <p>05 / Commercial independence</p>
          <p>Editorial conclusions stay editorial</p>
        </header>
        <div class="standard-section__layout">
          <div class="standard-section__title">
            <h2 id="commercial-title">A commercial relationship cannot determine the factual conclusion.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="standard-section__body">
            <p>
              Sponsors, advertisers, partners, and affiliates may not determine the
              factual conclusion of Portfilo editorial coverage.
            </p>
            <p>
              Commercial material must be clearly labeled. Advertising should not be
              presented as independent reporting. If a commercial relationship is
              relevant to how a reader would interpret a story, it should be
              disclosed.
            </p>
          </div>
          <aside class="evidence-note" aria-label="Commercial independence principle">
            <p class="evidence-note__label">Editorial rule</p>
            <p>Commercial support does not buy an editorial conclusion.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
        <p>Research & Standards</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="closing-title">The evidence sets the limit.</h2>
          <p>
            A stronger headline, cleaner argument, or faster draft is not a reason to
            claim more than the reporting supports. When material uncertainty remains,
            the story should show it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="site-footer__brand" aria-label="Portfilo">
        <span class="site-footer__port">Port</span><span class="site-footer__fi">fi</span><span class="site-footer__lo">lo</span>
      </div>
      <p>Practical intelligence for ambitious Filipinos</p>
      <a href="/">Back to home</a>
    </footer>

    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Instrument Sans";
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: swap;
        font-weight: 400 700;
        src: url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/instrument-sans:vf@5.3.0/latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "Source Serif 4";
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: swap;
        font-weight: 200 900;
        src: url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/source-serif-4:vf@5.3.0/latin-wght-normal.woff2") format("woff2-variations");
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono";
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: swap;
        font-weight: 400;
        src: url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/ibm-plex-mono@5.3.0/latin-400-normal.woff2") format("woff2");
      }

      :global(:root) {
        --paper: #f4f0e8;
        --ink: #171614;
        --muted: #69655e;
        --line: #cbc5bb;
        --accent: #0050a4;
        --accent-on-ink: #8fc7ff;
        --correction: #b42318;
        --correction-soft: #f6e7e3;
        --page-max: 100rem;
        --gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 3.3vw, 3.75rem);
        --grid-gap: clamp(0.8rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
        --sans: "Instrument Sans", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        --serif: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
        --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      }

      :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
      :global(html) {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-synthesis: none;
      }
      :global(body) { margin: 0; min-width: 0; background: var(--paper); }
      :global(a) { color: inherit; }
      :global(a:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
      :global(#standards-content:focus) { outline: none; }

      .skip-link {
        position: fixed;
        z-index: 20;
        top: 0.75rem;
        left: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper);
        font: 400 0.75rem/1 var(--mono);
        text-decoration: none;
        transform: translateY(-200%);
      }
      .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }

      .site-header,
      .standards-hero,
      .standard-section,
      .ai-section__inner,
      .closing,
      .site-footer {
        width: min(100%, var(--page-max));
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .site-header {
        padding: 1.05rem var(--gutter) 0.95rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3fr 6fr 3fr;
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        align-items: end;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      }
      .wordmark { width: fit-content; display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; }
      .wordmark__inner {
        display: inline-block;
        white-space: nowrap;
        font: 700 clamp(1.75rem, 2.2vw, 2.3rem) / 0.9 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.085em;
        transform: skewX(-12deg);
        transform-origin: left center;
      }
      .wordmark__port,
      .wordmark__fi,
      .wordmark__lo,
      .site-footer__port,
      .site-footer__fi,
      .site-footer__lo { display: inline-block; }
      .wordmark__port, .site-footer__port { color: var(--ink); }
      .wordmark__fi, .site-footer__fi { color: var(--accent); }
      .wordmark__lo, .site-footer__lo { color: var(--correction); }
      .site-header__strapline,
      .site-header__section {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font: 400 0.68rem/1.35 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .site-header__strapline { text-align: center; }
      .site-header__section { color: var(--ink); text-align: right; }

      .standards-hero {
        padding: clamp(3.8rem, 7vw, 7.5rem) var(--gutter) clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        column-gap: var(--grid-gap);
        row-gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      }
      .standards-kicker {
        grid-column: 1 / 4;
        margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
        color: var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.67rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .standards-hero h1 {
        grid-column: 3 / 13;
        min-width: 0;
        max-width: 14ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(3.7rem, 7.5vw, 7.8rem) / 0.9 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.068em;
        text-wrap: balance;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }
      .standards-intro {
        grid-column: 5 / 11;
        max-width: 43rem;
        margin: 0;
        font: 400 clamp(1.28rem, 1.7vw, 1.68rem) / 1.5 var(--serif);
      }
      .standards-index {
        grid-column: 1 / 13;
        margin-top: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
      }
      .standards-index__label {
        grid-column: 1 / 3;
        margin: 0;
        padding-top: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font: 400 0.64rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .standards-index ol {
        grid-column: 4 / 13;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
        list-style: none;
      }
      .standards-index li { min-width: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .standards-index li:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .standards-index a {
        min-height: 8rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 0.8rem 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .standards-index a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
      .standards-index span { color: var(--accent); font: 400 0.62rem/1.35 var(--mono); }
      .standards-index strong {
        font: 500 clamp(0.95rem, 1.25vw, 1.2rem) / 1.15 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      .standard-section { padding-inline: var(--gutter); scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }
      .standard-section__head,
      .ai-section__head {
        padding: 0.72rem 0 0.65rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        font: 400 0.64rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .standard-section__head p, .ai-section__head p { margin: 0; }
      .standard-section__head p:first-child, .ai-section__head p:first-child { grid-column: 1 / 5; color: var(--ink); }
      .standard-section__head p:last-child, .ai-section__head p:last-child { grid-column: 8 / 13; text-align: right; }
      .standard-section__layout {
        padding: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 6.5rem) 0 clamp(5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
      }
      .standard-section__title { grid-column: 1 / 6; }
      .standard-section h2 {
        max-width: 13ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(2.7rem, 4.8vw, 5rem) / 0.95 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.057em;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .standard-section__body {
        grid-column: 7 / 11;
        max-width: 39rem;
        font: 400 clamp(1.12rem, 1.35vw, 1.3rem) / 1.67 var(--serif);
      }
      .standard-section__body p { margin: 0 0 1.35em; }
      .standard-section__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      .evidence-note,
      .verification-flow,
      .correction-note {
        grid-column: 11 / 13;
        align-self: start;
        padding-top: 0.8rem;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.67rem/1.55 var(--mono);
      }
      .evidence-note p { margin: 0; }
      .evidence-note__label,
      .verification-flow > p,
      .correction-note > p {
        margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .verification-flow ol { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .verification-flow li { padding: 0.65rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .verification-flow span { display: inline-block; min-width: 2.2rem; color: var(--accent); }

      .ai-section {
        width: 100%;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper);
        scroll-margin-top: 1rem;
      }
      .ai-section__inner { padding: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem) var(--gutter) clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem); }
      .ai-section__head { border-top-color: var(--paper); border-bottom-color: #55524d; color: #bdb8af; }
      .ai-section__head p:first-child { color: var(--accent-on-ink); }
      .ai-section__statement {
        padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        align-items: end;
      }
      .ai-section__marker {
        grid-column: 1 / 4;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--accent-on-ink);
        font: 500 clamp(6rem, 12vw, 12rem) / 0.72 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.09em;
      }
      .ai-section h2 {
        grid-column: 5 / 13;
        max-width: 15ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(3rem, 5.5vw, 5.7rem) / 0.94 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .ai-section__columns {
        margin-left: 33.333%;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 5rem);
      }
      .ai-section__columns > div { padding-top: 0.85rem; border-top: 1px solid #55524d; }
      .ai-section h3 {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        color: var(--accent-on-ink);
        font: 400 0.67rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .ai-section ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        font: 400 clamp(1.06rem, 1.25vw, 1.2rem) / 1.58 var(--serif);
      }
      .ai-section li { position: relative; padding: 0.55rem 0 0.55rem 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #3f3d39; }
      .ai-section li::before {
        content: "■";
        position: absolute;
        top: 1.08rem;
        left: 0;
        color: var(--accent-on-ink);
        font-size: 0.34em;
      }
      .ai-section__rule {
        max-width: 52rem;
        margin: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem) 0 0 33.333%;
        padding-top: 1rem;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-on-ink);
        color: var(--paper);
        font: 500 clamp(1.45rem, 2.2vw, 2.15rem) / 1.22 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      }

      .correction-section .standard-section__head { border-top-color: var(--correction); }
      .correction-section .standard-section__head p:first-child { color: var(--correction); }
      .correction-note { padding: 1rem; border-top-color: var(--correction); background: var(--correction-soft); }
      .correction-note > p { color: var(--correction); }
      .correction-note dl { margin: 0; }
      .correction-note dl > div { padding: 0.65rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #d9bbb4; }
      .correction-note dt { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; color: var(--correction); text-transform: uppercase; }
      .correction-note dd { margin: 0; }
      .commercial-section { padding-top: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); }

      .closing {
        padding: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem) var(--gutter);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      }
      .closing > p {
        grid-column: 1 / 4;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.65rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .closing > div { grid-column: 5 / 11; }
      .closing h2 {
        max-width: 12ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(3rem, 5.7vw, 5.9rem) / 0.92 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.062em;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }
      .closing div > p {
        max-width: 41rem;
        margin: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem) 0 0;
        font: 400 clamp(1.15rem, 1.45vw, 1.4rem) / 1.6 var(--serif);
      }

      .site-footer {
        padding: 1.2rem var(--gutter) 1.4rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3fr 6fr 3fr;
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        align-items: end;
        font: 400 0.64rem/1.45 var(--mono);
      }
      .site-footer__brand {
        width: fit-content;
        white-space: nowrap;
        font: 700 1.55rem/0.9 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.085em;
        transform: skewX(-12deg);
        transform-origin: left center;
      }
      .site-footer p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .site-footer a {
